Are houses available for sale in Faisal Town Islamabad? | Yes. Current portal data shows active houses for sale in Faisal Town Phase 1/F-18, with dozens of listings across Blocks A, B and C. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}

Which block currently has the most houses for sale? | Current portal data shows Block C with the largest Phase 1 house inventory, followed by Block A, while Block B has fewer listings. :contentReference[oaicite:4]{index=4}

What is the current price of a 5-marla house in Faisal Town? | Recent 5-marla asking prices include examples around PKR 2.6 crore to PKR 2.95 crore, although premium houses may ask more. :contentReference[oaicite:5]{index=5}

What is the price of an 8-marla house in Faisal Town? | Current 8-marla examples include asking prices around PKR 4.1 crore to PKR 4.2 crore. Exact price depends on block, construction and condition. :contentReference[oaicite:6]{index=6}

Are 5-marla houses available in Block C? | Yes. Block C currently has substantial 5-marla house inventory, including brand-new and double-storey examples. :contentReference[oaicite:7]{index=7}

Should I inspect the house before paying a token? | Yes. Inspect the construction, seepage, roof, plumbing, electrical work, utilities, parking and exact street before making a material payment.

What documents should I verify? | Confirm seller identity, ownership or allotment record, transfer eligibility, dues, plot or house number, possession and any relevant transaction documents.

Should I buy a new or older house? | Compare location, construction quality, renovation cost and total price. A newer house may need fewer repairs, while an older house may offer a stronger location or better value.

Can I buy a rented house? | Yes, but confirm the tenancy agreement, tenant notice period, security deposit and exact vacant-possession arrangement before purchase.

Can I arrange a viewing? | Yes. Use the contact option to request current houses matching your preferred block, size and budget.
